OL,3,GNEWSAWedding venue in Orkney closed to
OL,4,Adeal with rat infestation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town hall and wedding venue in Orkney
OL,7,Fcould be closed into next year in a bid
OL,8,Fto tackle a rat infestation.
OL,10,FOrkney Islands Council said as well as
OL,11,Fputting down traps, pest controllers
OL,12,Fwere having to "strip back" the kitchen
OL,13,Fand remove other internal fittings in
OL,14,Fthe Stromness building to assess "the
OL,15,Fextent of the damage" caused by the
OL,16,Frodents.
OL,18,FGarry Burton, the council's head of
OL,19,Factive communities, said they hoped the
OL,20,Fformer church would be back in use in
OL,21,FJanuary.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
